      "desc": {
        "en": "During RQA testing of the ALPS78 H50, inconsistent results were found on the first ice-making cycle: some units produced ice, while others did not. Therefore, RQA requested a software update to add a one-time delay at ice-making start, allowing the heater to operate before water is supplied.",
